      "spriteDescript": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "type": "WideImageAndText",
      "textCaption": " You can click on the arrow button in the bottom-right corner to move on, like you’re doing right now!",
      "textName": "",
      "spritePortrait": "",
      "spriteDescript": "tutorials/tut 2",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "type": "PortraitAndText",
      "textCaption": "Along the way, <color=orange>Baby Joe</color> might have some problems to solve.",
      "textName": "Dr. Farke",
      "spritePortrait": "Portrait/dr",
      "spriteDescript": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "type": "WideImageAndText",
      "textCaption": "This is where you come in: help <color=orange>Baby Joe</color> make decisions as it grows! <color=orange>Baby Joe</color> needs YOUR help to live through his life as a baby <i>parasaurolophus.</i>",
      "textName": "",
      "spritePortrait": "",
      "spriteDescript": "tutorials/tut 2",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "type": "WideImageAndText",
      "textCaption": "Go ahead and click one of the three choices. Some might be partially correct, but remember—only ONE is the best path to survival. Look closely and choose the most scientifically accurate one!",
      "textName": "",
      "spritePortrait": "",
      "spriteDescript": "tutorials/tut 2",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "type": "PortraitAndText",
      "textCaption": "Now, I hope you're ready. \nLet’s start this incredible journey!",
      "textName": "Dr. Farke",
      "spritePortrait": "Portrait/dr",
      "spriteDescript": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "type": "PortraitAndText",
      "textCaption": "See you 75 million years ago!",
