            "answerType": "Wrong",
            "afterDialogs": [
              {
                "type": "TextOnly",
                "textCaption": "Uh-oh! The <i>Tetraphoneus</i> actually had a great sense of smell—perfect for finding out where its prey is.",
                "textName": "",
                "spritePortrait": "",
                "spriteDescript": "",
                "choices": []
              },
              {
                "type": "TextOnly",
                "textCaption": "To make it even worse, it was an ambush predator—a type of dinosaur that hides and jumps out at its prey to hunt it down.",
                "textName": "",
                "spritePortrait": "",
                "spriteDescript": "",
                "choices": []
              },
              {
                "type": "PortraitAndText",
                "textCaption": "It sees me!",
                "textName": "<color=orange>Baby Joe</color>",
                "spritePortrait": "Portrait/babyjoe_scray",
                "spriteDescript": "",
                "choices": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Run in a straight line across open ground",
            "afterText": "",
            "aftersprite": "",
            "sprite": "quests/new Q2-Q5 image/q2a2",
            "answerType": "NotWrong",
            "afterDialogs": [
              {
                "type": "TextOnly",
                "textCaption": "Almost! You run as fast as you can! \nYou’ve seen some other adult <i>Parasaurolophus</i> before. ",
                "textName": "",
                "spritePortrait": "",
                "spriteDescript": "",
                "choices": []
              },
              {
                "type": "TextOnly",
                "textCaption": "They can outrun the <i>Tetrophoneus</i>, so you can do it too! ...Right...?",
                "textName": "",
                "spritePortrait": "",
                "spriteDescript": "",
                "choices": []
              },
              {
                "type": "TextOnly",
                "textCaption": "Oh no! You’re a juvenile <i>Parasaurolophus</i>, and not as fast as an adult. Running alone is risky.",
